---
const stack = ['Astro', 'React', 'TypeScript', 'Tailwind CSS', 'GSAP', 'Node.js', 'Vercel', 'Netlify', 'Resend', 'Swiper'];
---
<section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-y border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-16 mb-9 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4">
    <div>
      <p class="font-mono text-lima text-xs tracking-widest uppercase">// nuestro stack</p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-display text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold max-w-2xl leading-snug">
        Las mismas herramientas con las que se construyen los productos
        <span class="text-lima">más rápidos de internet.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-moss max-w-xs md:text-right">
      Sin plantillas genéricas. Tecnología moderna, puesta a trabajar para tu negocio.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    data-ticker
    class="relative overflow-hidden"
    style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 7%, #000 93%, transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 7%, #000 93%, transparent);"
  >
    <div data-ticker-track class="flex gap-3 w-max">
      {stack.map((t) => (
        <span class="glass glass-hover rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-bone/70 hover:text-lima whitespace-nowrap flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-lima/60"></span>
          {t}
        </span>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
